    "authoring-app": "A human opens it. Cannot be called from a server.",
    "analysis": "Analyses existing content. Feeds generation but does not generate.",
    "infrastructure": "Numerical or runtime substrate. Implements no generative algorithm itself.",
    "post-processing": "Transforms already-generated output."
